data: {"id": "9ffb3502c7274ffd-thinking-parallel_evidence-1230", "run_id": "9ffb3502c7274ffd", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 证据结论\n\n### 已采集事实\n1. **Pod 当前状态**：aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-z7kdp 仍处于 **Pending** 阶段，容器 `app` 状态为 **Waiting**，Reason = **ImagePullBackOff**。Pod UID = `91141823-4070-43a3-810c-ddbf5a6b337f`，IP = `172.16.104.46`，调度在 node2。\n2. **Prometheus 指标**（首轮采集）：\n   - `kube_pod_status_phase=1` (phase=Pending) — 确认 Pending 状态仍然生效\n   - `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1` (reason=ImagePullBackOff) — 等待原因确认为 ImagePullBackOff\n   - `kube_pod_container_restarts_total=0` — 未发生过重启\n   - 无 `last_termina", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789043817917, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

